      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-1",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  -- put の書き込み先を省くとメッセージボックスへ\n  put \"mouseUp を受け取りました（\" & the name of me & \"）\"\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "1. ハンドラとメッセージ",
        "field-ref-body": "スクリプトは「ハンドラ」の集まり。メッセージを受け取ると、同じ名前のハンドラが動く。\n\non mouseUp\n  put \"押されました\"\nend mouseUp\n\n■ 画面から届くメッセージ\nmouseUp\n  ボタン・テキストパーツ・カードの何もない所を押した\nopenCard\n  カードを開いた\ncloseCard\n  カードを離れる\nopenStack\n  スタックを開いた\n\n■ 渡る順番\n部品 → カード → 背景 → スタック\n最初に見つかったハンドラが動く。\npass mouseUp で次へ渡せる。\n\n■ コメント\n-- から行末まではコメント。"
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "card-ref-02",
      "name": "put・get・go",
      "backgroundId": "bg-ref-page",
      "content": "",
      "picture": "",
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-2",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  put \"今日は\" && the long date\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "2. put・get・go",
        "field-ref-body": "■ put  値を書き込む\nput \"こんにちは\" into field \"msg\"\nput \"!\" after field \"msg\"\nput \"→\" before field \"msg\"\nput 42\n  書き込み先を省くとメッセージボックスへ\n\n■ get  値を it に入れる\nget field 1\nput it\n\n■ go  カードを移る\ngo next card\ngo prev card\ngo first card\ngo last card\ngo to card \"目次\"\ngo card 2\ngo back\n  前にいたカードへ戻る\n\n■ visual  次の go の効果\nvisual effect wipe left\nvisual effect dissolve fast\n  wipe right / dissolve / plain\n  速さ：very fast / fast / slow / very slow"
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "card-ref-03",
      "name": "answer・ask・音",
      "backgroundId": "bg-ref-page",
      "content": "",
      "picture": "",
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-3",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  ask \"お名前は？\" with \"ゲスト\"\n  if the result is \"Cancel\" then exit mouseUp\n  play \"chime\"\n  answer \"こんにちは、\" & it & \"さん！\"\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "3. answer・ask・音",
        "field-ref-body": "■ answer  知らせる・選ばせる\nanswer \"保存しますか？\" with \"いいえ\" or \"はい\"\n  押したボタンの文字が it に入る\n\n■ ask  入力してもらう\nask \"お名前は？\" with \"ゲスト\"\n  入力した文字が it に入る\n  キャンセルすると the result が Cancel\n\n■ beep・wait\nbeep 2\nwait 1 second\nwait 30 ticks\n  1 tick は 60分の1秒\n\n■ play  音を鳴らす\nplay \"chime\"\n  鳴らしたまま次の行へ進む\n\n■ 音の名前\nbeep  click  pop  boing\nchime  buzz  coin  fanfare"
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "card-ref-04",
      "name": "数と変数",
      "backgroundId": "bg-ref-page",
      "content": "",
      "picture": "",
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-4",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  global gCount\n  add 1 to gCount\n  put \"押した回数：\" && gCount\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "4. 数と変数",
        "field-ref-body": "■ 変数\nput 10 into x\n  宣言しなくても使える\nglobal gScore\n  ハンドラをまたいで使う変数\n  使うハンドラごとに書く\n\n■ 計算する命令\nadd 1 to field \"count\"\nsubtract 2 from x\nmultiply x by 3\ndivide x by 2\n\n■ 演算子\n+  -  *  /  ^\ndiv  割り算の整数部分\nmod  割り算の余り\n&   つなぐ\n&&  空白を挟んでつなぐ\n=  <>  <  >  <=  >=\nis  is not  contains  is in\nand  or  not\n\n■ 定数\nempty  true  false  return\nspace  tab  quote  comma\n\n全角の数字も数として扱う。"
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "card-ref-05",
      "name": "部品とプロパティ",
      "backgroundId": "bg-ref-page",
      "content": "",
      "picture": "",
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-5",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  set the label of me to \"押しました！\"\n  wait 1 second\n  set the label of me to the name of me\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "5. 部品とプロパティ",
        "field-ref-body": "■ 部品の指し方\nfield \"名前\"\nfield 2\nbutton \"名前\"\ncard field \"名前\"\nbg button 1\n  名前はパーツID、番号は重なり順\nme\n  スクリプトを持つ部品自身\nthe target\n  最初にメッセージを受けた部品\n\n■ プロパティ\nthe name of me\nthe visible of field 1\nset the label of button 1 to \"OK\"\nset the textSize of field \"msg\" to 18\n\n使えるプロパティ：\nname  label  text  visible\nlockText  clickable  sharedText\ntextSize  textAlign  scrollbar\nsound  left  top  width  height\n\n■ hide・show\nhide button \"ひみつ\"\nshow button \"ひみつ\"\n\n■ 背景\nthe name of this bg"
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "card-ref-06",
      "name": "制御",
      "backgroundId": "bg-ref-page",
      "content": "",
      "picture": "",
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-6",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  put 0 into total\n  repeat with i = 1 to 10\n    add i to total\n  end repeat\n  put \"1から10までの合計：\" && total\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "6. 制御",
        "field-ref-body": "■ if\nif x > 9 then\n  answer \"大きい\"\nelse\n  answer \"小さい\"\nend if\n\n1行でも書ける：\nif x = 0 then beep\n\n■ repeat\nrepeat 5 times\nrepeat with i = 1 to 10\nrepeat while x < 100\nrepeat until x > 100\nrepeat\n  どれも end repeat で閉じる\nexit repeat\nnext repeat\n\n■ 抜ける・止める\nexit mouseUp\nexit to HycarPerd\n\n■ 自分のハンドラ\non greet who\n  answer \"やあ、\" & who\nend greet\n  → greet \"花子\"\n\n■ 関数\nfunction double n\n  return n * 2\nend double\n  → put double(21)\n\n■ send\nsend \"mouseUp\" to button \"次へ\""
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "card-ref-07",
      "name": "式と関数",
      "backgroundId": "bg-ref-page",
      "content": "",
      "picture": "",
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "button-ref-example-7",
          "type": "button",
          "name": "例を実行",
          "label": "例を実行",
          "left": 8,
          "top": 396,
          "width": 304,
          "height": 36,
          "text": "",
          "style": "shadow",
          "visible": true,
          "lockText": false,
          "clickable": true,
          "textAlign": "left",
          "scrollbar": true,
          "sharedText": false,
          "textSize": 16,
          "sound": "",
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  put random(6) into dice\n  put word 2 of \"春 夏 秋 冬\" into season\n  put \"サイコロ：\" & dice & return & \"2番目の季節：\" & season\nend mouseUp"
        }
      ],
      "bgText": {
        "field-ref-title": "7. 式と関数",
        "field-ref-body": "■ チャンク（読み取りのみ）\nword 2 of x\nchar 1 to 3 of x\nline 1 of field \"memo\"\nitem 2 of \"a,b,c\"\n\n■ 数える\nthe number of cards\nthe number of buttons\nthe number of bg fields\nthe number of words in x\nthe number of this card\n\n■ 関数\nrandom(6)\nabs  round  trunc  sqrt\nlength  max  min  sum\naverage  offset\ncharToNum  numToChar\n\n■ 日付と時刻\nthe date\nthe long date\nthe time\nthe seconds\nthe ticks\n\n■ 結果\nthe result\n  直前の命令の結果"
      },
      "effect": "",
      "script": ""
    },
